WEBVTT

00:00.710 --> 00:11.390
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.730 --> 00:24.210
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.310 --> 00:31.310
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.140 --> 00:39.510
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.680 --> 00:42.820
If my wish comes true...

00:42.820 --> 00:49.570
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.570 --> 00:56.290
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.290 --> 01:05.800
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.110 --> 01:12.830
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.120 --> 01:23.510
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:31.590 --> 01:33.530
Go to the capital and play?

01:33.530 --> 01:36.520
Yeah, think about this...

01:36.520 --> 01:38.210
We've been studying since our first day of school,

01:38.210 --> 01:40.260
and haven't had a chance to go out and play, right?

01:40.260 --> 01:42.810
Since the Pri-Test is over, we should have some relaxation

01:42.810 --> 01:44.720
and have some fun at the Freeden of Flower.

01:44.720 --> 01:45.750
Let's go and play!

01:45.950 --> 01:47.750
That might be a good idea.

01:47.750 --> 01:50.480
There's a shop at the capital that sells really delicious ice cream.

01:50.480 --> 01:52.120
I really want to try them.

01:52.120 --> 01:53.560
Right, Onii-chan?

01:54.160 --> 01:55.260
Yeah.

01:55.560 --> 01:57.260
Priecia's going too, right?

01:57.430 --> 01:58.000
I'm not!

01:58.600 --> 02:02.140
I'm not like the rest of you.
I have to train during the holidays too!

02:02.140 --> 02:04.270
I don't have time to play with you guys.

02:05.170 --> 02:07.600
Ice cream... delicious...

02:07.600 --> 02:10.360
Oh, Kagura's interested in it too?

02:11.040 --> 02:13.860
"I love... delicious food..."

02:13.860 --> 02:15.070
That's what she said.

02:15.940 --> 02:17.480
There's no choice then.

02:17.480 --> 02:20.370
Since Kagura's so looking forward to it, I guess we can go.

02:20.370 --> 02:23.140
Is that true? I'm really happy.

02:23.140 --> 02:25.620
I haven't been to the capital before, so please take care of me.

02:26.630 --> 02:30.300
I refuse! Besides, this is the first time I've been to the capital too.

02:30.300 --> 02:31.630
Don't rely on me so easily.

02:31.780 --> 02:36.840
Hmm... The two of them look really suspicious.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.390
There's nothing of that sort.

02:40.280 --> 02:44.390
<i>Oh, Aruke... Chance, this is a chance. A chance!</i>

02:44.390 --> 02:47.770
<i>If she's the princess, her actions when she's outside should be somehow different.</i>

02:48.080 --> 02:52.840
<i>I must find out if Lady Priecia is the princess this time.</i>

02:52.840 --> 02:55.320
Umm, can I go too?

02:55.320 --> 02:57.490
Yes, of course, Bridget!

02:57.650 --> 02:59.780
Going to the capital with Lady Priecia...

02:59.780 --> 03:02.620
This is unforgivable. We also want to...

03:02.620 --> 03:05.390
I want to eat some ice cream too.

03:05.390 --> 03:06.290
Wait a second.

03:06.290 --> 03:07.500
The three of you...

03:08.480 --> 03:10.500
have to study for the Pri-Test.

03:15.210 --> 03:18.510
The Knights' Holiday

03:22.120 --> 03:23.870
I'm sorry! Have you guys been waiting?

03:23.870 --> 03:24.510
You're late!

03:24.670 --> 03:29.520
Geez... Doesn't your dictionary have the word "punctuality" in it?

03:29.520 --> 03:31.090
I'm really sorry...

03:31.090 --> 03:33.540
But, did I really make everyone wait so long?

03:33.540 --> 03:35.020
Lady Priecia...

03:35.490 --> 03:39.030
has been waiting... for thirty minutes.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.010
Eh!?

03:41.360 --> 03:44.740
It seems like you're actually the one looking forward to the ice cream the most.

03:45.520 --> 03:47.240
I'm not really...

03:47.400 --> 03:50.750
How unexpected of Priecia to be such a glutton.

03:50.750 --> 03:52.590
I'm absolutely not!

03:52.590 --> 03:55.360
Well, whatever. Let's go now!

03:54.750 --> 03:57.060
No! I'm not a glutton!

04:09.050 --> 04:11.640
Wow, you're so accurate!

04:11.640 --> 04:13.300
Kagura's so amazing!

04:14.230 --> 04:16.480
I'm just a little... experienced.

04:17.890 --> 04:20.530
This is really heavy. Really heavy.

04:20.530 --> 04:24.030
Kagura, Kagura! Give this one a try too!

04:24.030 --> 04:26.160
They're still continuing?!

04:27.980 --> 04:30.040
I wonder where everyone is...

04:30.040 --> 04:32.150
They must be having fun somewhere around here.

04:40.080 --> 04:42.020
What kind of game is this?

04:42.020 --> 04:43.300
Don't come in!

04:45.290 --> 04:46.260
What's that?

04:47.800 --> 04:51.070
Wow, this is amazing. It became like this.

04:51.070 --> 04:54.620
You insolent guy! Stop touching weird places!

04:55.610 --> 04:57.310
What, what, what?!

04:57.850 --> 04:59.320
It's really tight in here.

05:00.020 --> 05:02.470
That's because you forced your way in here!

05:02.870 --> 05:04.470
I'm going now.

05:05.310 --> 05:07.820
No, Priecia. So suddenly...

05:12.620 --> 05:15.500
This is bad! This is bad!

05:19.320 --> 05:20.760
Ouch...

05:21.480 --> 05:22.550
I'm sorry.

05:28.580 --> 05:30.470
What?! What's the meaning of this?!

05:30.470 --> 05:33.550
Why is Onii-chan on top of Priecia?

05:33.550 --> 05:34.970
Isn't it obvious?

05:34.970 --> 05:37.350
Hyaweh is assaulting Priecia!

05:39.210 --> 05:40.990
Assaulting...

05:40.990 --> 05:43.990
You idiot! Get away from me! Get away from me, right now!

05:43.990 --> 05:47.610
It's unforgivable... to assault... Lady Priecia!

05:49.030 --> 05:50.260
Priecia...

05:52.980 --> 05:54.600
What are you doing, Kagura?!

05:54.600 --> 05:55.410
Let's run!

05:57.690 --> 05:59.460
Oh, they're escaping.

05:59.670 --> 06:01.650
Abandoning their troubles and reasons...

06:01.650 --> 06:03.900
the elopement of a young man and woman!

06:03.900 --> 06:07.840
Did the two of them finally become adults after entering that house of love?

06:07.840 --> 06:10.350
No way! I will never allow that to happen!

06:17.140 --> 06:19.400
I'm beat...

06:20.450 --> 06:22.530
What is this place?

06:22.530 --> 06:25.320
I don't know, but it's really strange.

06:25.320 --> 06:26.460
Oh, that is...

06:26.460 --> 06:29.460
Welcome, welcome, the boss over there!

06:29.460 --> 06:32.130
If you come now, we'll give you a great service!

06:32.130 --> 06:34.450
Where's the boss? Who is he?

06:34.450 --> 06:39.300
What are you talking about? I'm talking about you, handsome guy.

06:39.300 --> 06:41.010
You're embarrassing me.

06:41.010 --> 06:43.820
But if I were to become a boss, what would I be doing?

06:43.820 --> 06:44.880
Sounds busy to me.

06:44.880 --> 06:46.170
That's of course...

06:46.170 --> 06:48.000
Getting surrounded by beautiful girls

06:48.000 --> 06:51.180
and intimating with them for two full hours, it'll be really busy.

06:54.840 --> 06:58.690
Bathing fee of 65000 Shi for 120 minutes.

06:58.850 --> 07:02.630
So this is the rumored public bath,
known as the "Bath House," right?

07:02.630 --> 07:04.190
It's so unexpectedly expensive.

07:04.190 --> 07:06.300
What are the two of you doing here?

07:06.300 --> 07:09.470
Walking around here in uniforms isn't good at all!

07:09.470 --> 07:10.360
Why?

07:10.360 --> 07:12.200
You guys...

07:12.200 --> 07:14.200
Hmm, the two of you...

07:15.120 --> 07:18.260
Oh, Boss... not really...

07:18.260 --> 07:19.710
Marquis...

07:20.010 --> 07:21.710
You're dating, huh?

07:22.170 --> 07:24.890
Date? Why would I...

07:26.430 --> 07:27.350
Let go of me!

07:28.210 --> 07:30.220
Is that wrong?

07:30.380 --> 07:31.830
Of course!

07:32.710 --> 07:35.330
Marquis, you smell nice.

07:36.300 --> 07:39.930
You smell like soap, did you go to the bath?

07:41.810 --> 07:44.940
If so, isn't the bath in the castle enough?

07:44.940 --> 07:49.600
Umm... it's not really a bath... but... ah...

07:49.600 --> 07:52.610
How should I explain this... It's just like what you know about...

07:53.380 --> 07:55.370
Please forgive him.

07:55.370 --> 07:55.980
Why?

07:55.980 --> 07:56.950
No why!

07:57.180 --> 07:59.010
Oh, yeah! That's right!

07:59.010 --> 08:00.740
You two should just hurry up and enjoy your time.

08:01.380 --> 08:04.400
That's why I said we're not on a date
and I'm not really enjoying myself.

08:04.400 --> 08:06.370
Really? I'm kind of enjoying it.

08:06.870 --> 08:09.460
What are you talking about? Let's hurry up and go!

08:10.800 --> 08:12.370
Oh, wait for me!

08:13.470 --> 08:16.150
It's good to see you all right, Boss!

08:16.150 --> 08:20.070
Yeah. I was so nervous I started sweating.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.170
Is that so, Boss...

08:21.170 --> 08:22.890
You have to come to my place once more...

08:25.320 --> 08:27.420
Welcome, please enjoy yourself!

08:29.080 --> 08:31.910
What should we do? Should we return to where everyone was?

08:31.910 --> 08:35.490
No, wouldn't it be nice to be like this for a little longer?

08:36.420 --> 08:38.950
Since we're lost, right?

08:38.950 --> 08:42.050
Then let's just walk around here looking for them.

08:42.050 --> 08:43.310
Oh, I see.

08:43.310 --> 08:47.100
Yeah! Geez, can't you use your brain to think more?

08:49.350 --> 08:52.320
What's going on? It's so crowded there.

08:52.320 --> 08:55.510
Ice cream? Is that the shop Filia talked about?

08:55.770 --> 08:57.450
So it is that shop.

08:57.450 --> 08:58.730
Let's hurry and take a look!

08:58.730 --> 09:00.520
Didn't I say to stop pulling me?

09:02.750 --> 09:05.910
It's amazing, Priecia! There are so many varieties.

09:05.910 --> 09:07.730
Don't be so excited, you embarrassing fool.

09:08.690 --> 09:11.990
Welcome. The two of you look really happy.

09:12.170 --> 09:15.990
The two of you will definitely love this color of ice cream.

09:15.990 --> 09:19.990
It's just like the color of blood.

09:33.730 --> 09:35.220
It's delicious, right?

09:37.090 --> 09:38.210
What's wrong?

09:38.210 --> 09:43.730
Are you asking me to be so impolite as to place the food directly into my mouth?

09:43.730 --> 09:45.640
But it's really delicious.

09:54.780 --> 09:55.770
It's delicious!

09:56.270 --> 09:57.130
Right?

10:06.100 --> 10:09.290
Really! This is delicious too!

10:12.290 --> 10:15.860
I thought that if we stayed and
waited for them, they would show up.

10:15.860 --> 10:17.380
They didn't come.

10:17.380 --> 10:19.120
They're late.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.800
Right now, the two of them should have already...

10:21.010 --> 10:23.900
What should they have done?

10:23.900 --> 10:27.810
No, there's no way I can answer that.

10:27.810 --> 10:29.520
No!

10:33.630 --> 10:35.070
It was delicious!

10:35.780 --> 10:39.470
It isn't bad to eat some commoner's food occasionally.

10:43.660 --> 10:47.970
The meals in the castle are always
luxury cuisine cooked by the chefs.

10:47.970 --> 10:51.330
I always have to keep my table manners in mind.

10:51.330 --> 10:54.380
I'm never too concerned about the taste of the food.

10:54.380 --> 10:57.920
Is that small place really my world?

10:57.920 --> 11:00.070
But it's beautiful.

11:01.290 --> 11:04.640
Being surrounded by the lake,
flowers blossoming on the mountains...

11:05.050 --> 11:08.600
with many animals around,
and a nice breeze constantly blowing.

11:09.010 --> 11:12.190
Yeah, it's a really beautiful place.

11:12.190 --> 11:13.800
That's right.

11:15.190 --> 11:18.530
I'm protecting this country...

11:19.380 --> 11:24.210
Well, I heard that when I was born,
this country was already at war.

11:24.210 --> 11:29.270
Everyone in the city is in a state of fear, pain, and despair.

11:29.270 --> 11:30.420
But...

11:32.780 --> 11:36.460
Those that I've seen today will not give up, even in that kind of situation.

11:36.460 --> 11:38.600
Continuing to live on unyieldingly...

11:38.600 --> 11:40.680
There's still a future for this country.

11:40.850 --> 11:44.160
In order to let Windland return and become a strong and wealthy country,

11:44.160 --> 11:46.150
I will continue to do my best.

11:48.030 --> 11:51.100
Hey, it's only started bothering me recently, but...

11:51.100 --> 11:54.190
What's that place? That blue colored place...

11:54.360 --> 11:56.190
Oh, that?

11:56.190 --> 11:57.920
That's the sea.

11:57.920 --> 12:01.650
The sea? That?! It's really that big?!

12:01.650 --> 12:03.420
This is the first time I've ever seen it!

12:03.420 --> 12:05.700
Well, let's go and have a look together next time.

12:06.150 --> 12:07.650
Together?

12:07.650 --> 12:13.030
That means... that's... a so-called... d-d-date?

12:13.030 --> 12:18.710
Date? Umm, yeah! Something like that.

12:18.710 --> 12:20.120
Date...

12:25.430 --> 12:26.710
This is the first time.

12:27.700 --> 12:31.730
This is the first time that I'm enjoying the outside world!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.870
That is...?

12:38.870 --> 12:39.860
This?

12:40.080 --> 12:42.240
This is my treasure.

12:45.370 --> 12:48.640
This pocket watch is said to be the history of this country.

12:48.640 --> 12:51.220
It's something that's even more important than my life.

12:51.220 --> 12:52.270
That important?

12:52.270 --> 12:55.750
Yeah, there's a story behind this pocket watch.

12:57.610 --> 13:01.730
This is said to be something given by a man to a woman.

13:01.730 --> 13:04.670
The two had been separated since they were young,

13:04.670 --> 13:09.430
met again many years later and finally married each other.

13:11.240 --> 13:15.260
This pocket watch contains the wish of all kinds of people.

13:15.260 --> 13:19.860
Since this has been passed down to me, I'll protect it with my life.

13:22.990 --> 13:27.490
But, your life is worth much more than this.

13:31.300 --> 13:33.000
That's not true.

13:34.420 --> 13:36.000
That's...

13:36.410 --> 13:38.000
Priecia?

13:38.880 --> 13:41.470
Sorry, please don't be bothered by this.

13:41.470 --> 13:43.750
You've finally shown yourself.

13:49.010 --> 13:50.730
It's these ninjas again, huh?

13:52.020 --> 13:54.870
That pocket watch is the best evidence.

13:54.870 --> 13:58.020
You're indeed the princess of Windland.

13:58.460 --> 13:59.370
Oh, no!

14:18.040 --> 14:19.090
Priecia!

14:19.090 --> 14:22.380
The boss didn't say to bring you back unharmed.

14:23.690 --> 14:24.890
This type of injury...

14:28.160 --> 14:29.390
Hyaweh?

14:29.390 --> 14:30.580
Withdraw!

14:30.580 --> 14:33.110
My aspiration for more than ten years is about to be fulfilled.

14:33.110 --> 14:35.650
Those officials should be very happy too.

14:35.650 --> 14:38.600
Hyaweh, open your eyes! Hyaweh!

14:39.000 --> 14:41.150
Prie...cia!

14:43.160 --> 14:45.450
Onii-chan... Onii-chan!

14:45.450 --> 14:47.120
Onii-chan, wake up!

14:52.450 --> 14:53.910
Are you all right?

14:53.910 --> 14:56.350
Priecia? Where's Priecia?!

14:56.820 --> 14:59.030
What happened to Priecia?

14:59.030 --> 15:00.420
Priecia was kidnapped!

15:01.060 --> 15:03.170
I'm going to save her now!

15:03.170 --> 15:05.830
Fel, hurry up and contact the academy!

15:05.830 --> 15:07.990
Filia, you go call the Marquis!

15:07.990 --> 15:08.680
Yes!

15:08.680 --> 15:10.660
I'm... going too.

15:10.660 --> 15:13.130
But, how can we catch up with them?

15:14.980 --> 15:17.820
On hando dohanbaya sowaka.

15:19.890 --> 15:21.440
That's a...?

15:21.440 --> 15:24.660
This is a shikigami, Sazanishiki.

15:24.660 --> 15:26.300
It's able to receive sounds.

15:27.620 --> 15:31.050
What's placed on Lady Priecia is called Koshihikari.

15:31.050 --> 15:33.610
It's able to pass the sound to Sazanishiki.

15:33.610 --> 15:36.240
I see. If we follow that sound,

15:36.240 --> 15:39.250
we should be able to find out where they are. Where they are.

15:44.250 --> 15:47.260
One... two...

15:47.260 --> 15:49.260
This is bad! This is bad!

15:54.510 --> 15:57.520
Hey! It's forbidden to use flying magic inside the academy!

15:57.520 --> 16:00.490
Instructor, this is bad!

16:02.460 --> 16:04.460
You can't do this, Filia!

16:04.460 --> 16:06.610
Boss is currently having an important meeting!

16:06.610 --> 16:07.930
Please let go of me!

16:07.930 --> 16:10.910
Marquis, if you don't hurry up, Priecia will...

16:10.910 --> 16:11.960
No~!

16:13.280 --> 16:14.880
Wait up.

16:14.880 --> 16:18.560
Can anyone escape from my love?

16:18.560 --> 16:20.750
No, none. Full—

16:20.090 --> 16:21.500
No!

16:29.910 --> 16:31.170
You're the worst.

16:31.170 --> 16:32.760
Boss...

16:37.750 --> 16:38.770
Priecia!

16:39.710 --> 16:43.020
You should value your life more.

16:43.020 --> 16:47.600
I, Chizakura, will take your life!

16:49.270 --> 16:53.200
You bastard! What did you do to Priecia?!

16:54.730 --> 16:55.740
What's that?!

17:01.690 --> 17:03.400
That light is...

17:11.630 --> 17:14.000
You aren't any ordinary human, brat.

17:14.480 --> 17:16.550
This is interesting!

17:21.660 --> 17:22.820
Lady Priecia.

17:25.170 --> 17:26.560
Hyaweh!

17:30.570 --> 17:31.790
Die!

17:39.060 --> 17:42.700
What's happening? Why did the battle barrier...

17:43.870 --> 17:45.210
Hyaweh!

17:45.530 --> 17:49.610
I see, she's here too.

17:50.590 --> 17:52.050
But this level is...

17:52.050 --> 17:53.760
Ryuugazan!

17:52.050 --> 17:53.760
Dragon Fang Slash

17:57.700 --> 18:01.030
God will never forgive such an atrocious act!

18:01.030 --> 18:04.570
A Tempelritter... This is looking bad.

18:04.570 --> 18:06.980
Shadow Ninjutsu. Shadow Bomb!

18:09.640 --> 18:11.590
Did he run away? What a coward!

18:11.590 --> 18:14.780
I'll chase him! Chase him!

18:16.800 --> 18:19.530
Are you... hurt?

18:19.530 --> 18:21.530
You idiot!

18:21.720 --> 18:23.420
Why did you save me?!

18:23.420 --> 18:26.540
You're not obligated to save me!

18:27.600 --> 18:28.680
Are you all right?

18:28.680 --> 18:30.040
I can stand on my own.

18:32.140 --> 18:34.960
I'm sorry. That's... thank...

18:35.560 --> 18:36.590
No...

18:39.230 --> 18:40.550
Thank you.

18:43.060 --> 18:47.060
It's great... that Lady Priecia is... all right.

18:47.220 --> 18:50.440
I'm sorry to drag everyone into such trouble.

18:50.440 --> 18:53.290
It's all right. We're also sorry.

18:53.290 --> 18:56.990
Come to think of it, it's all because of us chasing you.

18:56.990 --> 18:59.200
But it's really good to see you safe.

19:00.020 --> 19:02.200
Onii-chan!

19:04.200 --> 19:08.110
I've brought Boss, no... the Marquis here!

19:08.570 --> 19:10.300
Eh? Everything's over?

19:10.300 --> 19:11.850
Yeah, somehow.

19:11.850 --> 19:12.960
Are you all right?

19:12.960 --> 19:15.260
Yes, Marquis.

19:15.260 --> 19:18.040
Okay. That's good then.

19:21.130 --> 19:23.150
<i>Who the hell is that ninja?</i>

19:23.150 --> 19:26.860
<i>Are there other people besides me targeting the royalty?</i>

19:32.200 --> 19:33.980
<i>Darkness Knight?</i>

19:33.980 --> 19:36.330
That's too reckless, Chizakura.

19:37.410 --> 19:39.970
I was surprised by an unexpected opponent.

19:39.970 --> 19:44.150
But, since I know that she's the princess, the next time will...

19:50.400 --> 19:53.570
Will there be a next time for a fallen cherry blossom?

19:56.170 --> 19:58.260
<i>What's going on?</i>

19:58.260 --> 20:00.070
<i>If Darkness Knight knows that ninja,</i>

20:00.070 --> 20:04.270
<i>then that ninja is commanded by Lord Gerot, just like me?</i>

20:04.270 --> 20:07.310
<i>But I never heard anything about this.</i>

20:07.310 --> 20:11.270
<i>I don't know what's going on. Don't know.</i>

20:23.260 --> 20:26.490
You said that we'll have a date at the sea next time, right?

20:26.490 --> 20:27.690
Yeah.

20:27.690 --> 20:30.700
It's not that I can't accompany you during the next vacation...

20:31.380 --> 20:34.950
It can't be helped. Just treat it as a
thank you gift for saving me today.

20:34.950 --> 20:35.780
Really?!

20:35.780 --> 20:37.350
Thanks, I'm really happy.

20:38.050 --> 20:42.010
But, it'll be the first time I've had a date at the sea.

20:42.010 --> 20:45.680
What kind of clothes to wear, what kind of swimsuit to bring...

20:45.680 --> 20:48.020
Honestly, I can't decide on anything.

20:48.430 --> 20:49.520
So...

20:49.520 --> 20:51.620
Well, why not invite everyone to go?

20:53.160 --> 20:55.730
Everyone should go get some clothes, right?

20:57.010 --> 20:58.120
Everyone...

20:58.580 --> 20:59.350
What's wrong?

21:00.110 --> 21:02.450
Just what do you mean?

21:02.610 --> 21:04.040
What do you mean by "what"?

21:04.040 --> 21:08.300
It's a date, right? Isn't it just like everyone coming out and playing today?

21:08.300 --> 21:10.840
Is that so? Coming out to play, huh?

21:10.840 --> 21:13.300
That's what you've been thinking the whole day, huh?

21:13.960 --> 21:15.120
Priecia?

21:16.680 --> 21:22.520
You bastard! How much do you hate me to play with my heart like that?!

21:23.240 --> 21:26.510
No... Why are you saying such words?

21:26.510 --> 21:31.020
You don't have to say anymore.
You're treating me like a fool, right?

21:31.020 --> 21:33.520
I'm not! Why?

21:34.010 --> 21:37.020
Shut up... Shut up, shut up!

21:55.850 --> 22:02.080
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.460 --> 22:08.900
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:08.900 --> 22:15.690
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.690 --> 22:22.380
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.620 --> 22:29.470
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:29.970 --> 22:37.470
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.470 --> 22:43.400
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.400 --> 22:50.670
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:50.980 --> 22:57.450
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.700 --> 23:04.900
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:16.040 --> 23:19.710
Finally, we can freely use our power so there'll be real battle training next.

23:19.710 --> 23:23.280
Yet, Priecia and the rest aren't in the mood for it.

23:23.280 --> 23:25.880
As expected, I'm the only one that can be a heroine here...

23:25.880 --> 23:29.290
No way! That's super-ultra embarrassing!

23:29.290 --> 23:31.380
Next Episode, The Knights' First Battle.

23:31.380 --> 23:34.060
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:34.060 --> 23:36.630
Actually, I can become a heroine too, right?

23:34.560 --> 23:39.060
The Knights' First Battle
